        "headline": "英航BA252波音777-200ER據報短暫超出適用操作速限 機組調整高度後平安降落倫敦希斯洛",
        "summary": "上週北大西洋強勁噴射氣流期間，多架跨大西洋航班出現超速示警；英航BA252波音777-200ER在3萬8千呎巡航時，據報一度超出適用操作速限約7至10節。機組先後爬升至3萬9千及4萬1千呎，航班平安降落倫敦希斯洛，未傳出人員受傷或航機結構損傷。",
        "headline_en": "British Airways BA252 Boeing 777-200ER reportedly briefly exceeds its applicable operating speed limit, then lands safely at London Heathrow",
        "summary_en": "Several transatlantic flights reportedly experienced overspeed alerts during unusually strong jet-stream conditions over the North Atlantic last week. British Airways BA252, a Boeing 777-200ER, reportedly exceeded its applicable operating limit by about 7–10 knots while cruising at 38,000 feet. The crew climbed first to 39,000 feet and then to 41,000 feet; the flight landed safely at London Heathrow, with no injuries or structural damage reported.",
